      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CAPTAIN MOONLIGHT NZ (1) scored three runs back then missed the placings before bouncing back at his latest appearance over 2540m at West Wyalong, beaten 7 metres into third after being on the pace from the outset. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Ideally placed and is sure to prove tough to beat. MY MATE ACE (3) is racing very well this preparation with three wins to his credit, the latest effort a victory over 2180m at Kilmore. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a comparable field so he is capable of continuing his outstanding form. THE WISE GUY (2) must be considered after he finished third when resuming over 1690m at Kilmore a week-and-a-half ago. YARRAMAN JOLT (4) has solid form and is an each way prospect.",
